<title>USA: Donaldson Lufkin Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Donaldson Lufkin Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.35		    $1.01</p>
<p> Net			 86,400		   65,100</p>
<p> Revs		     978,211		  775,910</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,743		   59,576</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call consensus estimate $1.06/shr.  </p>
<p>Net income is before dividends on preferred stock.</p>
<p>Q1 underwriting revenues $173.9 million vs $135.4 million.</p>
<p>Q1 trading revenues $156.3 million vs $143.5 million.</p>
<p>Average return on equity for 1997 Q1 was 22 percent.</p>
</text>
